<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on red chips basket.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on red chips basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Monday it intended to issue 750 million American-style call warrants on a basket of 10 Hong Kong-listed red chip stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> Ng Fung Hong Ltd				   0.2   shrs</p>
<p> Guangnan (Holdings) Ltd			  0.07  shrs</p>
<p> CITIC Pacific Ltd				  0.075 shrs</p>
<p> China Aerospace International Holdings Ltd 0.31  shrs</p>
<p> China Travel Int'l Investment Hong Kong Ltd0.2   shrs</p>
<p> China Resources Beijing Land Ltd	     0.1   shrs</p>
<p> China Resources Enterprise Ltd		 0.12  shrs</p>
<p> Guangdong Investment Ltd			 0.15  shrs</p>
<p> Nam Fong International Holdings Ltd	  0.1   shrs</p>
<p> Cosco Pacific Ltd				  0.08  shrs</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.  </p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$12.21	 PREMIUM	   29.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.288	 GEARING	   4.03x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  07.APR.98	EXER LOT	  10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	SETTLEMENT DATE 21.JAN.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$11.63	 LISTING DATE    22.JAN.97</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
